    "text": "A particle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is moving with speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mtext>v</mtext></math> and collides with a mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></math> moving with speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>v</mtext></math> in the same direction. After the collision, the first mass is stopped completely while the second one splits into two particles each of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo></math> which move at an angle <math><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> with respect to the original direction. The speed of each of the moving particle will be",
